Using this code do the following:

Set the SDK & tools env variables

$ export PICO_SDK_PATH=/home/pi/ece177-S23/pico-sdk
$ export PICO_TOOLCHAIN_PATH=/usr/local/gcc-arm-none-eabi/bin/

Create the build directory

$ mkdir build

In the build directory, setup the build environment.
Be sure to specify the pico_w as the board

$ cd build
$ cmake -DPICO_BOARD=pico_w ..

Compile the code

$ make

Copy the UF2 file to the Pico

$ cp test-code.uf2 /media/pi/RPI-RP2
